  "title": "Healthy Turmeric Chicken Stew",
  "description": "This quick and easy turmeric chicken stew recipe combines chicken, sweet potato, and eggplant with a colorful sauce of turmeric, ginger, and garlic.",
  "authors": [
    "Stephanie"
  ],
